  concept: "Authored objective: Capture the balanced baseline.\nAuthored requirement:
    Recorded from solved midpoint voltages and verified bridge diagnoses. voltage
    \u2265 4.8 V. voltage \u2264 5.2 V.\nGeneral teaching principle: Bridge measurements
    compare relevant branch conditions and reference points; balance must be verified
    rather than assumed.\nOnly fresh, authoritative game evidence can establish that
    this objective is complete."
  analogy: Comparing two scales is useful only when both use compatible reference
    points.
  diagram: '[Authored setup] -> [Check prerequisites] -> [Observe the game evidence]
    -> [Verify objective]'
  misconception: A single matching midpoint voltage is not always sufficient to establish
    a healthy bridge.
  baseline: "Before working on \u2018Capture the balanced baseline\u2019, which component,
